sequenceDiagram
    participant C as MCP client
    participant B as bridge
    participant A as A2A agent
    B->>A: fetch agent card (startup)
    C->>B: tools/list
    B-->>C: one tool per skill
    C->>B: tools/call, as a task
    B->>A: SendMessage, return_immediately
    A-->>B: task, SUBMITTED
    Note over B,A: GetTask every 250 ms
    C->>B: tasks/get, at its own interval
    B-->>C: working + latest status message
    Note over B,A: the A2A task settles
    B-->>C: tool result (isError on failure)
